/head><body data-page_name="view_jam" class="locale_en jam_layout_widget layout_widget responsive no_theme_toggle" data-host="itch.io"><div class="small_logo gray jam_layout_header_widget header_widget base_widget" id="jam_layout_header_7682681"><a class="skip_to_main" href="#maincontent">Skip to main content</a><div class="primary_header"><h1 title="itch.io - indie game hosting marketplace" class="title"><a title="itch.io - indie game hosting marketplace" href="/" class="header_logo"><span class="visually_hidden">itch.io</span><img width="775" class="full_logo" src="https://static.itch.io/images/logo-black-new.svg" alt="itch.io logo &amp; title" height="199"/><img width="262" class="minimal_logo" src="https://static.itch.io/images/itchio-textless-black.svg" alt="itch.io logo" height="235"/></a></h1><div class="header_buttons"><a href="/games" class="header_button browse_btn" data-label="browse">Browse Games</a><a href="/jams" class="header_button jams_btn" data-label="jams">Game Jams</a><a href="/developers" class="header_button developers_btn" data-label="developers"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon icon-upload"></span>Upload Game</a><a href="/devlogs" class="header_button devlogs_btn" data-label="devlogs">Developer Logs</a><a href="/community" class="header_button community.home_btn" data-label="community.home">Community</a></div><form class="game_search" action="/search"><input name="q" type="text" placeholder="Search for games, jams, tags or creators" required="required" class="search_input"/><button aria-label="Search" class="submit_btn"><svg width="18" height="18" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden role="img" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="3" class="svgicon icon_search" version="1.1"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle><line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"></line></svg></button></form><div class="user_panel_widget base_widget" id="user_panel_2850767"><a data-register_action="header" href="/login" class="panel_button" data-label="log_in">Log in</a><a data-register_action="header" href="/register" class="panel_button register_button" data-label="register">Register</a></div></div><div data-target="browse" class="header_dropdown"><a href="/games/store">Indie game store</a><a href="/games/free">Free games</a><a href="/games/fun">Fun games</a><a href="/games/tag-horror">Horror games</a><div class="divider"></div><a href="/tools">Game development</a><a href="/game-assets">Assets</a><a href="/comics">Comics</a><div class="divider"></div><a href="/sales">Sales</a><a href="/bundles">Bundles</a><div class="divider"></div><a href="/jobs">Jobs</a><div class="divider"></div><a href="/tags">Tags</a><a href="/game-development/engines">Game Engines</a></div></div><div class="jam_page_wrap" id="wrapper"><div class="view_jam_page view_jam_base_page page_widget base_widget view_jam_default during_voting has_banner" id="view_jam_2018049"><div class="jam_banner_outer"><img src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI4NDI0MDI0LnBuZw==/original/GXRPkC.png" class="jam_banner "/></div><div class="jam_body"><div class="jam_header_widget base_widget" id="jam_header_3465257"><div class="header_inner"><div class="header_columns"><div class="title_colum"><h1 class="jam_title_header"><a href="/jam/new-wierd-game-jam">New Wierd Game Jam</a></h1><div class="jam_host_header">Hosted by <a href="https://siwdvi.itch.io">siwdvi</a> · <a href="https://bsky.app/hashtag/wierd">#wierd</a></div></div><div class="stats_container"><div class="stat_box"><a href="/jam/new-wierd-game-jam/entries"><div class="stat_value">72</div><div class="stat_label">Entries</div></a></div><div class="stat_box"><div class="stat_value">356</div><div class="stat_label">Ratings</div></div></div></div><div class="header_tabs"><a class="header_tab active" href="/jam/new-wierd-game-jam" data-label="tab_view_jam">Overview</a><a class="header_tab" href="/jam/new-wierd-game-jam/entries" data-label="tab_view_jam_entries">Submissions</a><div class="tab_group"><a class="header_tab" href="/jam/new-wierd-game-jam/community">Community</a><span class="community_activity">19</span></div><a class="header_tab" href="/jam/new-wierd-game-jam/feed" data-label="tab_view_jam_feed">Submission feed</a></div></div></div><div class="submitter_outer"><div class="jam_submitter_widget base_widget during_voting" id="jam_submitter_3825086"><div class="date_data">Submissions open from <span data-format="MMMM Do YYYY [at] h:mm A" class="date_format">2026-07-27 00:00:00</span> to <span data-format="MMMM Do YYYY [at] h:mm A" class="date_format">2026-08-01 00:00:01</span></div><div class="countdown"><span class="countdown_label">Voting ends in</span><div class="times"><div data-name="years" class="time_block"><div class="block_value"></div><div class="block_label">years</div></div><div data-name="months" class="time_block"><div class="block_value"></div><div class="block_label">months</div></div><div data-name="days" class="time_block"><div class="block_value"></div><div class="block_label">days</div></div><div data-name="hours" class="time_block"><div class="block_value"></div><div class="block_label">hours</div></div><div data-name="minutes" class="time_block"><div class="block_value"></div><div class="block_label">minutes</div></div><div data-name="seconds" class="time_block"><div class="block_value"></div><div class="block_label">seconds</div></div></div></div><div class="state_action">Submission is closed and voting is now in progress</div></div></div><div class="jam_content user_formatted"><h3 class="text-center">Hey you!</h3>
<blockquote>?</blockquote>
<h3 class="text-center">Yes, you!</h3>
<blockquote>What do you want?</blockquote>
<h3 class="text-center">Ever felt like life is way too boring?</h3>
<blockquote>What? No!</blockquote>
<h3 class="text-center">Ever wanted to add a little spark to your life?</h3>
<blockquote>Please stop with these questions</blockquote>
<h3 class="text-center">Have a desire to try out something&nbsp;<em>new</em>?</h3>
<blockquote>I mean sure but-</blockquote>
<h1 class="text-center">Welcome to the New Wierd Game Jam!!!</h1>
<p class="text-center">The 13th seasonal <strong>Wierd Game Jam</strong> that holds the <strong>wierdest strangest craziest unhingiest thingmabobiest games</strong> to ever come into a man&#x27;s mind! Make your wierd game in a time period of&nbsp;July 27th 2026 at 00:00 EST to August 1st 2026 at 00:00 EST <strong>(5 days)</strong>!<br>If you feel like 5 days is too short for the creation of your game, check out the&nbsp;<a href="https://itch.io/jam/new-wierd-game-jam-extended" target="_blank">extended version of this jam</a>!</p>
<h3 class="text-center">The THEME🧐</h3>
<p class="text-center">The New Wierd Game Jam, just like all of the Old Wierd Game Jams, has a&nbsp;<strong>theme:<br>SWEET DREAMS!!<br></strong>Make a game about sweet dreams! Could be anything dream-related, the dreams don&#x27;t have to be sweet, or the sweets don&#x27;t have to be dreamed. Build your game around the theme!<br></p>
<h3 class="text-center">The RULES😨</h3>
<ul><li class="text-justify"><strong><em>Can I Join?&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</em></strong>Yes, the New Wierd Game Jam is looking for people that can produce the<strong> New Wierd Games</strong> that we all crave, and this could just be <strong>you</strong>! Or it couldn&#x27;t. The New Wierd Game Jam is a <strong>gamble</strong>. And the moment you realise that you will unserstand just how <strong>awesome</strong> the New Wierd Game Jam is!</li><li class="text-justify"><strong><em>Can I for some unknown reason restrain myself from making my game Wierd?&nbsp; &nbsp; </em><del></del><del></del><em></em></strong><del></del><strong>All games</strong> in the jam can be considered &quot;wierd enough&quot;, however everyone else is looking for truly wierd games and, really, you should ask&nbsp;that question to<strong> yourself</strong> first<em></em></li><li class="text-justify"><strong><em>Can I know more about the theme?&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</em></strong>The New Wierd Game Jam features a New Wierd <strong>Theme</strong>&nbsp;which you may include in your game, but if your New Wierd <strong>Idea</strong> is better you can just make it your way! Just make sure to make it stand out from all the normal games, in other words including the theme allows you to also <strong>submit the same game to multiple other jams</strong> at once</li><li class="text-justify"><strong><em>Can I express all my feelings to that one annoying guy or to life in general in my game?&nbsp; &nbsp;</em><em></em><del></del></strong> Unfortunately the world we live in is a sad, imperfect, serious and <strong>not wierd</strong> (<em>audience gasp</em>) world, but, even if our tongues cannot be tamed, our hands that make the game can be, so <strong>discriminatory speech, hateful language, excessive gore, nudity blah blah blah all that is not allowed</strong>. There is <strong>always</strong> <strong>someone</strong> who knows how to deal with that one annoying guy and clear your head from those thoughts</li><li class="text-justify"><strong><em>Can a human help me?&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</em><em></em><em></em><em></em><em></em></strong>Yes, teams can be of <strong>any</strong> size, shape and color! Just make sure to credit those who assisted you in your wierd journey, otherwise you&#x27;re all alone on that one guy you forgot about</li><li class="text-justify"><strong><em>Can a non-human help me?&nbsp; &nbsp; </em></strong>Unless you&#x27;re talking about emotional support from pets or divine intervention (both of which are allowed and encouraged) you cannot add <strong>AI content</strong> in your game UNLESS it is completely <strong>obvious</strong> that it was made by AI (so you may add italian brainrot to your game if your heart sees it as a nessessary thing to do), this allows us to still judge New Wierd Games accordingly</li><li class="text-justify"><strong><em>Can my game be so Wierd to the point that it&#x27;s&nbsp;unplayable?&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</em></strong>Asking players to download <strong>external files</strong> will not let you gain trust of many people playing the game (i hope so). Otherwise <strong>unusual controls, visuals, play styles and anything else that is Wierd</strong>&nbsp;can lead to a Newer Wierder Game that may take the <strong>spotlight</strong>!</li><li class="text-justify"><strong><em>Can I use external assets for my game?&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</em></strong>Just like all the other Normal Game Jams this jam has a submission peroid for a reason: to give us a game-making excersize of making a game, planning and working under stress in a short amount of time. However, because you would use some assets for your non-game-jam game anyways, you&nbsp;<strong>can </strong>use game assets to save some time, just remember to credit the creator of the assets!<span></span></li></ul>
<h3 class="text-center">The VOTING🤩</h3>
<ul><li><strong><em>Wierdness (the main criteria):&nbsp;&nbsp;</em></strong>How wierd and unnatural the game is in your eyes, sounds straightforward and is straightforward</li><li><strong><em>Originality:&nbsp;&nbsp;</em></strong>Everything boring has already been made or considered. This criteria is for how much the game sets itself apart from everything that already exists</li><li><strong><em>The theme fitness:&nbsp;&nbsp;</em></strong>How well is the theme implemented in the game, how much of it is presented and how much it affects the general game experience</li><li><strong><em>Art</em><em>:&nbsp; </em></strong>For art, music, sounds, story and everything non-gameplay in the game</li><li><strong><em>Gameplay:&nbsp;&nbsp;</em></strong>For the general game experience you had with the game</li></ul>
<h3 class="text-center">The SERVER🗣</h3>
<p class="text-center">Join our&nbsp;<a target="_blank" href="https://discord.gg/axhaCyFb6A" referrerpolicy="origin" rel="nofollow noopener">discord server</a> for jam updates, finding teammates, having fun and being Wierd!<br>The winner of this jam will get the Wierdest Guy role in the server as a sign of honor!</p></div></div><div id="entries" class="grid_outer"><div class="header_row"><h2>Submissions<span class="game_count">(71)</span></h2></div><div class="jam_filter_picker"><div class="filter_item active">All submissions</div><span class="divider"> · </span><div data-filter="filter_web" class="filter_item">Browser playable (52)</div><span class="divider"> · </span><div data-filter="filter_windows" class="filter_item">Windows (25)</div><div data-filter="filter_osx" class="filter_item">macOS (3)</div><div data-filter="filter_linux" class="filter_item">Linux (4)</div></div><div class="jam_filter_empty"><p>No submissions match your filter</p></div><div class="game_grid_widget base_widget browse_game_grid"><div dir="auto" class="game_cell filter_windows has_cover lazy_images" data-game_id="4841254"><div style="background-color:#0f0f0f;" class="game_thumb"><a href="https://kolopolo4ka.itch.io/fragments-of-dreams" data-label="game:4841254:thumb" class="thumb_link game_link" tabindex="-1" data-action="game_grid"><img width="315" height="250" class="lazy_loaded" data-lazy_src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI4OTM1NDA3LnBuZw==/315x250%23c/%2Fnl18i.png"/></a><div class="game_cell_tools"><a data-register_action="add_to_collection" href="/g/kolopolo4ka/fragments-of-dreams/add-to-collection" class="action_btn add_to_collection_btn"><span class="icon icon-playlist_add"></span>Add to collection</a></div></div><div class="game_cell_data"><div class="game_title"><a href="https://kolopolo4ka.itch.io/fragments-of-dreams" data-label="game:4841254:title" data-action="game_grid" class="title game_link">Fragments of Dreams</a></div><div class="game_author"><a href="https://kolopolo4ka.it